      485.08
    ],
    "text": "Convening of the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lankaon Tuesday, 23rd April, 2019 at 1.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      504.01,
      546.33,
      545.08
    ],
    "text": "I, Karu Jayasuriya, Speaker of Parliament do hereby notify that in pursuance of Standing Order 16 of the Standing Orders ofParliament, I have summoned the Parliament to meet on Tuesday the 23rd day of April 2019 at 1.00 p.m. having beenrequested so to do by the Hon. Prime Minister.",
